          "short": "In order: $5.0625,\\ 1,\\ 0.0625,\\ 0,\\ 0.0625,\\ 1,\\ 5.0625$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(-1.5)^4&=5.0625\\\\(-1)^4&=1\\\\(-0.5)^4&=0.0625\\\\0^4&=0\\\\0.5^4&=0.0625\\\\1^4&=1\\\\1.5^4&=5.0625\\end{align*}$$",
