          "worked": "Plot $(-1.5,5.0625)$, $(-1,1)$, $(-0.5,0.0625)$, $(0,0)$, $(0.5,0.0625)$, $(1,1)$ and $(1.5,5.0625)$ using 2 cm per unit on both axes. Join them with a smooth curve, flat at the origin and rising on both sides.",
